  "description": "A crisp classic,\nInspired by the bold character of Modelo, this limited-edition 29\" Goon delivers a clean white frame dressed in regal gold and navy details. Custom-branded accents, rich patterned pads and saddle, and a polished chrome fork make this bike shine from every angle — whether it’s posted on the curb or rolling deep through the city.\nBuilt on Throne’s signature Goon geometry with Maxxis tires, double-wall rims, and sealed hubs, it’s a ride that blends premium styling with real rideability.\nThis collab is a salute to those who ride with pride — confident, fresh, and always down to roll.\nLimited drop. Don’t miss the ride.",
